    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Reimu  $Orin  $Satori  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Reimu Hakurei",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >I'm glad I placed my bets on you after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I can take some time off work without feeling guilty. I couldn't care less about the Lunar Capital anymore."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hey-wait, is Gensokyo going back to normal?"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >If I release my power, Gensokyo will return to its usual state."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"Depends on me\"? What’s that supposed to mean...?"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Hakurei Shrine."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A shrine on the outskirts of Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Orin  >Awww, you're alive?"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >What's that all of a sudden."
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Orin  >How disappointing, I came here all excited because a pungent scent of death reached underground."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Satori  >I see, that explains it."
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >That aside, what do you mean by a pungent scent of death?"
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Orin  >I don't really get it, but it's like the presence of living things got fainter, like I couldn't sense them anymore."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Oh, so that's what you meant.",
                "<l$> I guess that's how you must have perceived the incident."
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Ugh, here comes another unsettling person."
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >....You're just downright unsettling."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Satori  >It's likely that this strange princess, Yuiman, had her memories were altered."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hey, don't just start reading my memories!"
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Satori  >Apologies, I was wondering why you're in possession of a stone containing my power."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >You're power? Oh, this Incident Stone?"
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Satori  >Yes. However, even after looking into your mind I couldn't find out why. What could this possibly mean..."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Could you stop reading my mind?"
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Satori  >....I see, this Yuiman princess has created a paradise resembling her home inside the pyramid."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She might be holding a crucial secret."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >You're still reading my mind huh?"
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "From what she could surmise, the effects the incident did not seem to reach Old Hell."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Noticing the changes happening on the surface, it seems that the folks of from old hell have started their own investigation."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even after hearing Reimu's resolution of the incident, they still hold their suspicions."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A big part of that lies with the Incident Stone."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Moreso because Reimu seemed to have no idea about it."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ever the detective, perhaps Satori will take on the pyramid?"
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That would be a different story...or maybe not?"
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No.05 The Cheating Detective Satori Loses a Lead$>"
            ]
        }
    }
